<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66025" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελίνη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], ἡ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλυμος</span>
			, <i>Italian millet, Setaria italica</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.117
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνήμη μελίνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					608
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <i>millet-fields</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.4.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				8.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> name of an
			animal, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα μελίνης ἄνεργον</span>”
				<i>Edict.Diocl. Geronthr.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.29
				</span></i>
			 (v.l.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελεινον</span>
			<u>Aeg.</u>); perh. <i>badger</i>, cf. Lat.
				<i>mēles, mellina.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πολύποδός τι μέρος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
